{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"125298","name":"Dar el Ghalia","description":"Nestled in the heart of Fes's ancient medina, within the Andalusian district, this magnificent 18th-century palace, once belonging to a prominent Fassi family, offers a charming guesthouse experience. Just steps from R'cif Square, accessible via Bab Jdid Gate, the hotel places you amidst vibrant local life, with restaurants, Al Karaouine Mosque, and Muse Nejjarine within easy reach. For outdoor enthusiasts, the Mischliffen ski area and Dair Aoua Lake are 36 km away, while the city of Meknes is approximately 66 km from the property. Each room is arranged around a central patio, adorned in a lush Oriental style evoking the enchanting atmosphere of Arabian Nights. The terrace presents an opportunity to savor local Fes cuisine and refreshing drinks while enjoying panoramic views of the medina's countless minarets.","address":"Ross Rhe Ras Jnane Medina De Fes, 13-15","city":"FEZ","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"30110","lat":34.05973799457283,"lng":-4.974631349702804,"giataCode":"110173","phone":"+212535741574","email":"resa@riadelghalia.com","website":"www.riadelghalia.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_014.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_012.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_020.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_031.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_032.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/125298/125298a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"h